0..55 Comment "// The site that hosts the migration model\'s far world."
56..58 Comment "//"
59..135 Comment "// A site is one place a world runs at, the key it proves and the sockets it"
136..211 Comment "// is reached at. Written as a file, the place stays out of the program and"
212..232 Comment "// out of the flags."
233..235 Comment "//"
236..314 Comment "// `gandr host --site` binds these sockets in place of `--net-bind`. It proves"
315..390 Comment "// the key with the secret this site names: `GANDR_SECRET_FAR` holds it, or"
391..468 Comment "// the model `--secrets` names. The secret never stands in the file. This key"
469..525 Comment "// is the one the two-process test\'s host secret proves."
526..528 Comment "//"
529..605 Comment "// - see: `two-processes.manifold.gandr` — the manifold placing `far` here"
606..662 Comment "// - see: `two-processes.gandr` — the program it hosts"
663..731 Comment "// - see: `crates/surface-driver/tests/net.rs` — the two processes"
733..793 Comment "// The deployment theories, from `std.manifold` by its path."
